{"hw":"οὐδέτερος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">οὐδέτερος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">οὐδέτερ-ος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">α</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">not either, neither of the two</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.51</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1412</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phlb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">21e</span> </span>: in pl., when each party is pl., first in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hes.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">638</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">171</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.76</span> </span>, etc.: divisim, v. ἕτερος <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1</span> </span>. <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">οὐδετέρως</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">in neither of two ways</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">902c</span> </span>: also neut. pl. as <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span>, = οὐδετέρως, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Plt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">258a</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">184a</span> </span>, etc. </div> <div cla